Rule 4 (all elements in the axis tuple must be unique)
{v_1 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_1.len - 1] : ∀j ∈ [0, v_1.len - 1] : i = j ∨ v_1[i] ≠ v_1[j]
